WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Hi, friends. Gani here.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Hands resting in your lap. Shoulders soft.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Today we breathe like bees.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
A bee makes a soft hum. We can hum too, with our breath.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Breathe in through your nose. Then close your lips, and hum as the breath comes out.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Let's try it together. Breathe in…

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:58.000
And hum as you breathe out. Hmmmm…

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Again. Breathe in, slow and easy…

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Hum it out, soft and low. Hmmmm…

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:24.000
One more, even softer — a bee far away. Breathe in…

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Hmmmm…

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Last one. Breathe in…

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:46.000
And let the hum fade, all the way to quiet. Hmmmm…

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:57.000
Now just sit in the quiet.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:04.000
Notice your lips. Notice your hands. Soft and still.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Eyes up. Hands back.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:12.000
Ready to learn.
